Dear {!Contact.FirstName},
Thank you for completing your Incomplete Grade Request form. A copy of the form for your records is attached and serves as an official notice to you that your request for an Incomplete has been granted.To remove the Incomplete you must complete all the work described on the form by your instructor. Arizona State University policy grants you one calendar year to complete the work, with this year measured from the last day of the semester in which you received the Incomplete. In some circumstances (for example, separation from service, retirement) your instructor may specify an earlier completion date. Earlier completion dates must be approved by the Associate Director for Academic Affairs in the School of Music. Please contact musicstudents@asu.edu if you have any questions. Sincerely,
Julie Stephens Coordinator, Academic Affairs + Admissions Arizona State University | Herberger Institute for Design and the Arts P.O. Box 870405 | Tempe, Arizona 85287-0405 Phone: 480-965-5069 {!Case.Thread_Id}
